A comment does not split a nested list boundary

```
- o
  - a



  %% c

  - b
.
<ul>
  <li>o
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- o
  - a


  %% c

  - b
.
<ul>
  <li>o
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
